1
00:01:43,490 --> 00:01:47,750
[KING OF COMEDY]

2
00:01:48,430 --> 00:01:50,920
[Episode 18]

3
00:01:57,350 --> 00:01:58,150
He's awake.

4
00:02:04,650 --> 00:02:06,000
That's amazing! That's amazing!

5
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,520
That's amazing.

6
00:02:09,310 --> 00:02:10,430
It's good that you're okay.

7
00:02:10,430 --> 00:02:11,000
It's good that you're okay.

8
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,600
It's good that you're awake.

9
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:14,960
He's okay.

10
00:02:15,310 --> 00:02:16,560
It's good that you're awake.

11
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,030
Easy.

12
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,360
Hold steady.

13
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,930
It's good that you're okay.

14
00:02:26,310 --> 00:02:27,120
You're awake!

15
00:02:48,310 --> 00:02:49,150
When did you realize

16
00:02:49,150 --> 00:02:51,079
that this sea monster was not real?

17
00:02:52,470 --> 00:02:53,240
I...

18
00:02:54,710 --> 00:02:57,070
never thought it was real.

19
00:02:57,230 --> 00:02:59,240
He said it was real, and I bought it.

20
00:02:59,430 --> 00:03:01,630
Then what were you thinking

21
00:03:01,630 --> 00:03:03,280
when you bravely jumped into the sea?

22
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,880
He did cause a bit of trouble.

23
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,650
She must have really needed me.

24
00:03:06,650 --> 00:03:07,760
He doesn't even know how to swim.

25
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:09,070
I had to save him when he jumped in.

26
00:03:09,070 --> 00:03:10,060
A hero rescuing a damsel in distress

27
00:03:10,060 --> 00:03:12,810
is a traditional Chinese virtue.

28
00:03:13,030 --> 00:03:14,240
But thanks to him,

29
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:16,040
I was able to get this sea monster

30
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,560
out of the sea.

31
00:03:17,870 --> 00:03:18,520
Of course,

32
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:21,470
without her courage and determination,

33
00:03:21,690 --> 00:03:22,870
the fake sea monster case

34
00:03:22,870 --> 00:03:24,680
would never have been solved.

35
00:03:25,150 --> 00:03:26,910
Then can I ask you, the Condor Heroes,

36
00:03:26,910 --> 00:03:27,630
to take a photo together

37
00:03:27,630 --> 00:03:29,680
for the cover of our Shacheng Times?

38
00:03:34,870 --> 00:03:36,150
Sure, sure.

39
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:39,290
Come on, Condor Heroes, look here.

40
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,560
Three, two, one.

41
00:03:41,910 --> 00:03:46,390
[Sapu Condor Heroes vs the Sea Monster]

42
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,430
I hereby declare

43
00:03:51,750 --> 00:03:54,060
that Shapu Village's marine projects

44
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:56,400
are officially reopening!

45
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:07,030
Launch the boat! Launch the boat!

46
00:04:09,190 --> 00:04:09,840
Come on.

47
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,800
Let's take a group photo here.

48
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:11,430
Let's take a group photo.

49
00:04:11,430 --> 00:04:12,120
Coming.

50
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:14,370
When are you, the Condor Heroes,
planning to get married?

51
00:04:14,370 --> 00:04:14,920
Thank you.

52
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:15,680
Have fun.

53
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:17,279
When are we getting married?

54
00:04:20,510 --> 00:04:21,510
No.

55
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:25,070
This way.

56
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,480
Welcome.

57
00:04:27,970 --> 00:04:29,570
You guys stopped me back then

58
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:31,190
from leading the men on a suicide mission
to lure the monster into Shapu.

59
00:04:31,190 --> 00:04:32,950
Otherwise, who knows
who the Condor Heroes would be?

60
00:04:32,950 --> 00:04:34,080
Who would know that?

61
00:04:34,310 --> 00:04:36,000
At least I'd be the condor.

62
00:04:36,390 --> 00:04:37,510
Haidan is back.

63
00:04:37,510 --> 00:04:38,630
Mr. Shark is awesome.

64
00:04:38,630 --> 00:04:39,270
I support Zhen.

65
00:04:39,270 --> 00:04:40,330
Mr. Haidan is back.

66
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,310
Where did you go?

67
00:04:41,310 --> 00:04:42,150
Are you okay?

68
00:04:42,150 --> 00:04:43,360
Let me tell you.

69
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,830
As soon as I went out to sea,

70
00:04:44,830 --> 00:04:47,800
I met a huge sea monster.

71
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,870
It was huge.

72
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:53,409
There's no sea monster. It's fake.

73
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,430
Did you go play cards again?

74
00:04:55,430 --> 00:04:56,150
No.

75
00:04:56,150 --> 00:04:58,120
Come on. You're getting on your knees
on the washboard when we get home.

76
00:04:58,120 --> 00:04:59,040
Don't hit me.

77
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,870
You met a sea monster this time, right?

78
00:05:00,870 --> 00:05:02,800
Go home and kneel on the washboard!

79
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,600
Where's Jiahao? Did you see him?

80
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,050
Where's Jiahao?

81
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,290
Where's Jiahao?

82
00:05:08,270 --> 00:05:08,920
Jiahao.

83
00:05:09,390 --> 00:05:10,050
Chief Fang.

84
00:05:10,070 --> 00:05:12,330
We've already taken care of the signage,

85
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,630
publicity,

86
00:05:14,310 --> 00:05:15,240
and merchandise

87
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,240
for the sea monster attraction.

88
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:19,300
You must learn your lesson this time.

89
00:05:19,310 --> 00:05:20,970
This must never happen again.

90
00:05:21,950 --> 00:05:23,410
Now that Ma Feiyan's gone,

91
00:05:23,510 --> 00:05:24,440
our top priority

92
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:27,480
is arranging for the village committee
to take over management of the resort.

93
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:30,190
The chamber of commerce needs
to come up with a plan ASAP.

94
00:05:30,190 --> 00:05:32,320
Rest assured. We will do it right away.

95
00:05:32,870 --> 00:05:33,470
By the way,

96
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:34,920
what did you want?

97
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:41,800
Chief Fang is really something at work.

98
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:44,860
I've learned a lot.

99
00:05:46,330 --> 00:05:48,010
Zhen and Ms. Zhou Ke

100
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:50,620
have already informed the major media

101
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,850
that this matter

102
00:05:52,150 --> 00:05:54,340
was most likely planned by Ma Feiyan alone

103
00:05:54,340 --> 00:05:55,950
and has nothing to do
with Chuanao Village.

104
00:05:55,950 --> 00:05:57,050
It's been cleared up.

105
00:05:57,050 --> 00:05:58,430
Thank you so much. Thank you.

106
00:05:58,430 --> 00:05:59,680
It's the least I could do.

107
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:01,240
Please thank them for me.

108
00:06:01,750 --> 00:06:02,360
Of course.

109
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:14,070
The only downside

110
00:06:14,070 --> 00:06:16,950
is that Gao Jiaoqi and Fei got away.

111
00:06:17,410 --> 00:06:20,140
But I firmly believe
that no one escapes justice.

112
00:06:20,190 --> 00:06:21,360
They won't get away with it.

113
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,160
Yes, yes.

114
00:06:22,750 --> 00:06:23,400
Yes, yes.

115
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:27,950
Well,

116
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:30,720
Chief Fang,

117
00:06:31,190 --> 00:06:32,590
do you have time tonight?

118
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:35,150
I have some other things...

119
00:06:36,390 --> 00:06:38,190
We need to work on the plan.

120
00:06:43,430 --> 00:06:44,830
Then how about next week?

121
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:49,770
Maybe some other time.

122
00:06:54,230 --> 00:06:55,690
Then how about next month?

123
00:06:59,070 --> 00:07:00,330
Maybe some other time.

124
00:07:08,740 --> 00:07:09,590
All right.

125
00:07:09,610 --> 00:07:11,240
You guys get back to work.

126
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,460
I'll head back to the village.

127
00:07:19,190 --> 00:07:19,650
Well...

128
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,070
Jiahao,

129
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:31,610
I hope we'll meet again at the top.

130
00:08:01,510 --> 00:08:03,510
Um, thanks, but I'm good.

131
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:07,630
Chief.

132
00:08:07,630 --> 00:08:08,090
Well...

133
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:08,840
Well...

134
00:08:09,750 --> 00:08:10,210
Well...

135
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,050
Go do what you need to do.

136
00:08:24,750 --> 00:08:26,150
Jiaoqi, have some water.

137
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:29,280
Get one for me.

138
00:08:31,870 --> 00:08:32,730
Just eat yours.

139
00:08:32,750 --> 00:08:33,390
Jiaoqi.

140
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:34,659
Where are we going?

141
00:08:34,870 --> 00:08:36,480
Mr. Huang booked us flights

142
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:37,840
to lay low for a while.

143
00:08:39,549 --> 00:08:40,080
Where to?

144
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,909
I think it's the Silver Triangle.

145
00:08:44,390 --> 00:08:46,550
But I heard it's very dangerous there.

146
00:08:46,910 --> 00:08:48,220
There are a lot of scammers.

147
00:08:48,220 --> 00:08:49,620
Aren't we scammers, too?

148
00:08:49,630 --> 00:08:51,390
Don't worry about
how many competitors there are.

149
00:08:51,390 --> 00:08:52,390
With the two of us,

150
00:08:52,670 --> 00:08:53,600
we'll be top dogs

151
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,080
over there.

152
00:09:11,790 --> 00:09:12,920
We're about to dock.

153
00:09:13,750 --> 00:09:14,750
Once we get there,

154
00:09:15,150 --> 00:09:15,950
we'll be safe.

155
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,320
I'm sorry.

156
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,450
I was too impatient.

157
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,150
It's okay.

158
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:27,750
After all,

159
00:09:28,790 --> 00:09:30,480
you became like this for us.

160
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:34,640
It's nothing.

161
00:09:35,270 --> 00:09:36,030
Honey.

162
00:09:36,630 --> 00:09:37,430
Rest assured.

163
00:09:38,820 --> 00:09:41,550
From now on,
I'll talk things over with you first.

164
00:09:47,670 --> 00:09:48,750
L-Look,

165
00:09:48,870 --> 00:09:50,000
what is that?

166
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,030
What is it?

167
00:09:53,030 --> 00:09:54,550
Sea... sea monster. Sea monster!

168
00:09:54,550 --> 00:09:55,280
Sea monster!

169
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:59,330
Hurry, get in! Get inside!

170
00:09:59,330 --> 00:09:59,990
Get inside.

171
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:09,390
Eat some more. Eat some more.

172
00:10:09,390 --> 00:10:10,550
-What about
-It's delicious.

173
00:10:10,550 --> 00:10:11,600
my feelings?

174
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:12,870
While we're eating,

175
00:10:12,870 --> 00:10:14,330
I'd like to say a few words.

176
00:10:14,510 --> 00:10:15,550
Normally,

177
00:10:15,550 --> 00:10:16,600
I only make 3 points.

178
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,720
But today I'm going to make 4.

179
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,140
One more.

180
00:10:18,140 --> 00:10:19,080
-No problem.
-One more.

181
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:20,000
We put in a lot of effort.

182
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,530
First, who should we thank?

183
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,600
Silly Qiang, Wen,

184
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:25,120
Junnan,

185
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:25,600
and me.

186
00:10:26,270 --> 00:10:27,790
Don't rush. Why?

187
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:29,320
Junnan, do you remember

188
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,920
the words you said back then?

189
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,460
I put myself on the line

190
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:34,080
to lure the monster into Shapu.

191
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:34,550
Wasn't it impressive?

192
00:10:34,550 --> 00:10:35,150
-I said it.
-Yes.

193
00:10:35,150 --> 00:10:35,840
-Wasn't it impressive?
-Yes.

194
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:36,720
I was so moved that day.

195
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:37,940
-My tears...
-Although

196
00:10:37,940 --> 00:10:39,290
he didn't actually

197
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:41,240
do anything,

198
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:43,270
really, when you said those words,

199
00:10:43,270 --> 00:10:45,240
really, our momentum...

200
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:46,910
-How was it?
-The vibe of a warrior

201
00:10:46,910 --> 00:10:47,630
was already there.

202
00:10:47,630 --> 00:10:48,480
That aura...

203
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:49,790
Just feel it.

204
00:10:50,030 --> 00:10:51,320
Today, right here,

205
00:10:51,510 --> 00:10:54,910
I dub you the first Baturu of Shapu!

206
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,320
N-No problem.

207
00:10:57,550 --> 00:10:58,080
You.

208
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:58,480
No problem.

209
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:00,080
The first Baturu!

210
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,240
-Good!
-Good!

211
00:11:01,670 --> 00:11:04,030
Well, Baturu

212
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:06,000
wants to say a few words.

213
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:06,630
Go ahead.

214
00:11:06,630 --> 00:11:07,160
Go ahead.

215
00:11:08,270 --> 00:11:12,000
I've always been a tough guy.

216
00:11:12,910 --> 00:11:14,510
But now this tough guy

217
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:16,260
has a soft spot.

218
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:19,440
I used to only have one word in my heart:

219
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,790
Shapu, Shapu.

220
00:11:21,150 --> 00:11:22,150
But now...

221
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,030
Now...

222
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:25,550
it's Ximei, Ximei.

223
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,360
This is really...

224
00:11:28,670 --> 00:11:30,000
Bottoms up. Bottoms up.

225
00:11:30,750 --> 00:11:33,120
Well, he did get the ball rolling.

226
00:11:33,550 --> 00:11:35,200
The second point I want to make

227
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,270
is about Ximei.

228
00:11:37,280 --> 00:11:39,010
Now we're talking about Ximei.

229
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:40,600
Ximei,

230
00:11:40,910 --> 00:11:43,120
although she wasn't on the front lines,

231
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:45,320
she has always had our backs,

232
00:11:45,510 --> 00:11:48,170
continuously providing us
with intelligence,

233
00:11:48,630 --> 00:11:49,960
and kept our spirits up.

234
00:11:50,030 --> 00:11:50,870
W-Without it,

235
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,080
could we have done it?

236
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,720
We couldn't make it, right?

237
00:11:55,630 --> 00:11:56,490
The third point

238
00:11:56,870 --> 00:11:58,600
is about Bingqiang.

239
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:01,070
He wasn't on the front line,

240
00:12:01,150 --> 00:12:01,550
right?

241
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:04,550
Nor was he in the rear.

242
00:12:04,550 --> 00:12:05,480
Then where is he?

243
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,200
He's right here.

244
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:09,750
I just want to thank him, okay?

245
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:10,240
Okay.

246
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,240
-I can't accept a reward I haven't earned.
-Any problem?

247
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:12,790
-I can't accept a reward I haven't earned.
-Thank you, Bingqiang.

248
00:12:12,790 --> 00:12:13,840
Not at all.

249
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:14,480
Sorry.

250
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:15,960
The fourth is about our star here.

251
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:17,840
Thanks to our Condor Heroes.

252
00:12:18,150 --> 00:12:21,670
Condor Heroes.

253
00:12:21,670 --> 00:12:22,870
Well, now,

254
00:12:22,870 --> 00:12:23,670
I won't say it.

255
00:12:23,870 --> 00:12:25,440
You guys say it yourselves, okay?

256
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:25,840
Okay.

257
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,080
Stand up. Stand up.

258
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:28,550
Stand up. Say a few words.

259
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:30,170
Say a few words. Come on.

260
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,120
Say a few words.

261
00:12:32,150 --> 00:12:33,410
They get embarrassed.

262
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:35,150
Then...

263
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:36,360
It's okay if you don't want
to say anything.

264
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:38,030
Then kiss.

265
00:12:39,030 --> 00:12:40,030
Come on, kiss.

266
00:12:40,030 --> 00:12:40,840
Don't mess with me.

267
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:42,360
Kiss.

268
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:43,270
Zhou Ke!

269
00:12:43,270 --> 00:12:43,960
Kiss.

270
00:12:44,270 --> 00:12:45,100
What kiss?

271
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:48,080
No one is kissing my sister.
You can kiss me.

272
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,000
Stop messing around.

273
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:49,870
You're making her embarrassed.

274
00:12:49,870 --> 00:12:50,790
Nonsense. Don't...

275
00:12:50,790 --> 00:12:52,080
Just kidding.

276
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:53,200
Couldn't you at least give us a heads-up?

277
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:53,910
Right, right, right.

278
00:12:53,910 --> 00:12:55,910
Well, I'll spare you the speech.

279
00:12:56,390 --> 00:12:57,450
Let's have a drink.

280
00:12:57,550 --> 00:12:58,870
This is the Nv'er Hong wine my dad buried

281
00:12:58,870 --> 00:12:59,670
when I was born.

282
00:12:59,670 --> 00:13:00,440
We are happy today.

283
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:01,550
How about we open it and drink it?

284
00:13:01,550 --> 00:13:03,270
This is for when you get married.

285
00:13:03,270 --> 00:13:04,810
We are happy today.
Let's make an exception.

286
00:13:04,810 --> 00:13:05,600
An elder brother is like a father.

287
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:06,390
I agree, okay?

